n<!-- Adthrive Ad Block Recovery : END OF BODY -->\n<!--------------------------------------------->\n<!---------------->\n<!-- Script End -->\n<!---------------->\n</div>\n<!-- end content -->\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>\n</div>", "6": "<div class=\"bulbapediamonobook-body\" id=\"bodyContent\">\n<!-- start content -->\n<div class=\"mw-body-content\" id=\"mw-content-text\"><div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\">\n<h2><span id=\"Route_111_.28south.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Route_111_(south)\">Route 111 (south)</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a class=\"mw-file-description\" href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/File:Hoenn_Route_111_E.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-height=\"2240\" data-file-width=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1050\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/thumb/7/7f/Hoenn_Route_111_E.png/300px-Hoenn_Route_111_E.png\" srcset=\"https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/thumb/7/7f/Hoenn_Route_111_E.png/450px-Hoenn_Route_111_E.png 1.5x, https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/thumb/7/7f/Hoenn_Route_111_E.png/600px-Hoenn_Route_111_E.png 2x\" width=\"300\"/></a><figcaption>Route 111</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Leading north from <a href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Mauville_City\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Mauville City\">Mauville City</a>, the lengthy <a href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Hoenn_Route_111\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hoenn Route 111\">Route 111</a> is a unique path split into three parts by the large desert in its center. A powerful sandstorm rages on, forcing travelers to detour around it on their way past. A house belonging to the <a href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Winstrate_family\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Winstrate family\">Winstrate family</a> stands at the water's edge.\n</p>\n<table class=\"expandable\" style=\"margin: auto; background: #75C977; border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -khtml-border-radius: 10px; -icab-border-radius: 10px; -o-border-radius: 10px;; border: 5px solid #A2E0A3;\">\n<tbody><tr align=\"center\">\n<th>Trainers\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table align=\"left\" class=\"roundy\" style=\"border: 2px solid #4AA14D; background: #75C977; margin-right: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-top-left-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius-topleft: 5px; -webkit-border-top-left-radius: 5px; -khtml-border-top-left-radius: 5px; -icab-border-top-left-radius: 5px; -o-border-top-left-radius: 5px; background: #A2E0A3\">Trainer\n</th>\n<th style=\"border-top-right-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius-topright: 5px; -webkit-border-top-right-radius: 5px; -khtml-border-top-right-radius: 5px; -icab-border-top-right-radius: 5px; -o-border-top-right-radius: 5px; background: #A2E0A3\">Pokémon\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"15\" style=\"background: #A2E0A3; color: #000000\">Southern end\n</th></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\" style=\"background:#FFF;\">\n<td rowspan=\"1\">\n<table>\n<tbody><tr align=\"center\" style=\"background:#FFF\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Camper_(Trainer_class)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Camper Tyron\"><img alt=\"Camper Tyron\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-height=\"64\" data-file-width=\"64\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/e/e1/Spr_RS_Camper.png\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\" style=\"background:#FFF\">\n<td width=\"20px\">\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Camper_(Trainer_class)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Camper (Tr